# CPE-1753: staging dir the sharded CI workflow copies the built app binary + tauri-driver into, so one
# build job can hand them to every shard job as a single artifact. Runner-only — never created by a local
# run, never committed. Deliberately NOT dot-prefixed: `actions/upload-artifact@v4` silently excludes
# anything under a dot-directory unless `include-hidden-files: true` is set, and a build artifact that
# vanishes silently would make every shard fail with "release binary not found".
dist-app/
# Local msedgedriver.exe fetched to match this machine's installed Edge/WebView2 build (README
# "Running this locally") — never a checked-in dependency, and the pinned .cargo/bin copy is often a
# version behind after an Edge auto-update.
msedgedriver.exe
